{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8e8d6006945d280abef","chatId":"632475cb88644ef68b0caed677e42687","sessionId":null,"userId":69326,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":962,"promptTokens":1470,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:48"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008574969247246251,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e8d6006945d280abee","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369768380,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8e8d6006945d280abee","chatId":"632475cb88644ef68b0caed677e42687","sessionId":null,"userId":69326,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n亚当斯教授正在指导约翰完成一个物理学实验。尽管约翰并不擅长科学，他仍努力专注于实验。工作几小时后，约翰完成了实验并发现结果是符合预期的。他松口气并给亚当斯教授打电话分享了结果。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，亚当斯教授最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 钦佩\nB) 反对\nC) 感激\nD) 释怀\nE) 悔恨\nF) 绝望\n\n## 问题 2\n亚当斯教授为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他的学生成功地完成了实验\nB) 中文场景：约翰向他寻求帮助，以进行实验\nC) 他教给约翰物理学中的一个难懂的概念\nD) 他很高兴约翰与他分享了结果","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008574969247246251,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e8d6006945d280abef","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369768377,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"fbe26b70fba247509586f751649868cb"}